            <h3>
              All bikes and e-bikes on campus must be registered
            </h3>

            <p class="mb-0">
              Registration is <strong>free and required</strong> for all
              students, faculty, and staff bringing a bike to the Brakebills
              campus. With registration, you also receive:
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>A simple, secure location to store your bike details.</li>

              <li>
                A better chance at recovering your bike if it’s stolen or lost.
              </li>

              <li>Alerts regarding your bike during construction or events.</li>

              <li>
                Complimentary bike lock cuttings if your lose your key or forget
                your combination.
              </li>

              <li>Complimentary card-swipe access to commuter bike cages.</li>
            </ul>
